WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.400
Buying a home is already complicated.

00:02.400 --> 00:06.200
9 out of 10 homebuyers overpay for their mortgage.

00:06.200 --> 00:09.700
American homeowners overpay $3,343 on their mortgage every year.

00:09.700 --> 00:13.200
Good rates exist. The system just doesn't make them compete.

00:13.200 --> 00:18.000
Bankrate makes lenders compete for your loan. Until the best rate wins.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
You don't have to overpay.
A consumer-first motion study inspired by Bankrate.
Designed and built by Raj Shah.
